	abstract = {We investigate planning and learning temporal abstractions in cooperative multi-agent systems using common information approach and report the competitive performance of our proposed algorithm with baselines in grid-world environment. {\textcopyright} 2020 International Foundation for Autonomous Agents and Multiagent Systems (IFAAMAS). All rights reserved.},
