	abstract = {The proceedings contain 121 papers. The topics discussed include: sensorimotor analogies in learning astract skills and knowledge: modeling analogy-supported education in mathematics and physics; modeling context in cognition using variational inequalities; using analogy to transfer manipulation skill;s a computational approach to re-interpretation: generation of emphatic poems inspired by Internet blogs; from visuo-motor to language; integration of inference and machine learning as a tool for creative reasoning; research approaches to creartivity: weaving the threads; emotional context in imitation-based larning in multi-agent socities; a world with or without you: terms and conditions may apply; and other similarity by humans and machines.},
